---
title: "exchangeRateCurrent (Compound V2: cTokens)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_accrue: accrueInterest()
    q_accrue --> q_check_supply: check totalSupply == 0
    q_check_supply --> q_initial: totalSupply == 0
    q_initial --> [*]: return initialExchangeRateMantissa
    q_check_supply --> q_calc: totalSupply > 0
    q_calc --> q_compute: exchangeRate = (getCash() + totalBorrows - totalReserves) / totalSupply
    q_compute --> [*]: return exchangeRate

    note right of q_compute
        INV-001: exchangeRate = (getCash + totalBorrows - totalReserves) / totalSupply
        INV-002: exchangeRate is monotonically non-decreasing over time (assuming no bad debt)
        INV-003: exchangeRate scaled by 1e(18 - 8 + underlyingDecimals)
    end note

    note right of q_initial
        INV-004: when totalSupply == 0, return initial rate (0.02e18 typically)
        INV-005: getCash + totalBorrows >= totalReserves (numerator non-negative)
    end note
